# Custom Domain Configuration
# 
# To use a custom domain (e.g., roguerush.com):
# 
# 1. Uncomment the line below and replace with your domain
# 2. Configure DNS at your domain provider:
#    - Add CNAME record: @ → YOUR_USERNAME.github.io
#    - Or A records pointing to GitHub IPs:
#      185.199.108.153
#      185.199.109.153
#      185.199.110.153
#      185.199.111.153
# 3. Push this file to GitHub
# 4. Enable in Settings → Pages → Custom domain
#
# Example:
# roguerush.com
#
# Leave commented to use default: YOUR_USERNAME.github.io/rogue-rush/
